{"id":"int-6fdf3848ed1887787c23698c681e5cda","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-01T03:13:23.302194Z","actor":"vigneshwar.mk","issue_id":"claude-scheduler-cfn.1","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"server.js: GET list/:id/conversation/image, POST rename/resume, DELETE — no SSE per WIP.md:169. needSessions 501 guard mirrors needProjects; image route re-derives realpath guard. Mutation-checked: 501 guard and traversal guard each broken and watched fail (traversal test first version was a false negative — fixed to serve a real secret image before trusting it). 8 new tests, 413/413. Scope note: no Touch ID gate on rename/delete — plan doesn't list sessions among gated actions. Commit 2b6889d."}}
