{"id":"int-568ae645a98ebd57e650b096ba349d54","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-01T03:55:30.638462Z","actor":"vigneshwar.mk","issue_id":"claude-scheduler-cfn.2","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Sessions tab shipped per spec: vendored marked 18.0.7 + DOMPurify 3.4.12 (real files, zero symlinks, conventions test green over them), token block, tooltip.js/md.js/transcript.js/sessions.js, chip-grid cards with cwdGuessed marked as guessed, labelled actions, arm-then-confirm scoped to session delete with the airlock carve-out pinned by test, run↔session cross-links both directions. 4 guards mutation-checked (sanitiser bypass, proseEl bypass, vendor version swap, hard-pause confirm removal) — each red then restored. Injection attacks run and sanitised. Smoke-loaded over CDP against real ~/.claude/projects: 85 cards, 34-turn conversation with markdown + paired tool turns, zero console errors. 426/426. Commit follows in log. NOT done here, folded into a6o/cfn.3: search-hit expansion + >700-char prompt auto-collapse; deep multi-scenario browser pass is cfn.3."}}
{"id":"int-85c75133d13b6a5921be1c5fc75045f4","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-01T04:04:41.188358Z","actor":"vigneshwar.mk","issue_id":"claude-scheduler-a6o","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Per-tool renderers in public/transcript.js behind TOOL_BODY_RENDERERS with try/catch generic fallback: Bash $-line + stdout/stderr split, Edit/Write structuredPatch hunk diffs (no diff library), Read nested-collapse, TodoWrite before/after checklists with changed-row highlight, Grep numFiles/numMatches in the collapsed header. Also landed the two items deferred from cfn.2: expandSearchHits() and >700-char prompt auto-collapse. proseEl/renderMarkdown sanitiser contract untouched; exported API unchanged (additive only). 3 mutation checks (diff sign map, stderr merge, dispatch-throws) each red then byte-identical restore. 15 new tests, 442/442. Commit 219473f."}}
{"id":"int-1ed7dabc8750de25a165e2fc3d7de5e9","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-01T04:14:12.412138Z","actor":"vigneshwar.mk","issue_id":"claude-scheduler-7yf","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"GET /api/settings exposes read-only approvalDegraded/approvalDegradedReason from approval.available(); PUT cannot write them. renderApprovalNotice() in app.js inserts the notice at the top of #settings-form only when degraded — honest copy listing exactly which gates proceed unprompted. Mutation-checked API test (hardcoded field → red). Browser-verified with CS_FORCE_PLATFORM=linux sandbox: notice visible in Settings. Commit 51540e1."}}
{"id":"int-876f14539558bfa4efccf4c499ca95f7","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-01T04:14:12.987186Z","actor":"vigneshwar.mk","issue_id":"claude-scheduler-3ut","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Root cause: overlap guard inserts a zero-duration skipped stub AFTER the real run, so lastRun() returned the stub and the row rendered ▶ instead of ⤓/■ — hiding a RUNNING job's controls behind its own stub. Fix: decorate() prefers an actually running/queued run (activeRunFor), falls back to lastRun. Pinned WIP.md:56 overlap-before-admission behaviour untouched (different path). Mutation-checked (revert to lastRun alone → red). Browser-verified: sleep-30 job + overlap fire, row shows ⤓+■. Commit 51540e1."}}
{"id":"int-8e40481151d0c3b813ff5e436da0e04a","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-01T04:14:13.55116Z","actor":"vigneshwar.mk","issue_id":"claude-scheduler-3qd","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Claude run drawer joins run.meta.sessionId → GET /api/sessions/:id/conversation and renders via shared public/transcript.js (#log-transcript reusing s-transcript styles); raw tail kept for shell runs and any failure (404/501/network). CS_SESSIONS_ROOT override added for sandboxed verify. Browser-verified: planted fixture transcript + matching run, drawer rendered turns with pre hidden; shell run drawer unchanged in the same session. Commit 51540e1."}}
