{"id":"int-ba02cf5c97004d8b9752df38ca664404","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-01T05:00:20.588274Z","actor":"vigneshwar.mk","issue_id":"claude-scheduler-9o8","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Root cause (found by cfn.3's drive, confirmed by instrumenting the select's value setter): showTab wrote #history-job.value before syncHistoryJobOptions() ever built the options — silent no-op, then refreshRuns re-applied the empty prev. Fix: pendingHistoryJob carried until options exist, applied in syncHistoryJobOptions, cleared once resolvable (unknown id → All jobs). Browser-verified in a sandboxed daemon: same-document hash nav from Jobs → select carries the id, list shows only that job's run. Mutation-checked by stashing the fix: value='' and both jobs leaked, exactly the reported defect. 444/444."}}
